---
config:
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: false
    actorMargin: 52
    messageMargin: 32
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Scheduler
    participant Health as Health service
    participant Registry as Model registry
    participant Store as Evidence store
    participant Live as WebSocket manager
    participant View as Health view

    loop each monitoring interval
        Scheduler->>Health: Evaluate observed and deployment cohorts
        Health->>Registry: Resolve route and verified reference
        Registry-->>Health: Compatible reference evidence
        Health->>Store: Load bounded observations and feedback
        Store-->>Health: Cohort evidence
        Health->>Health: Compute quality and drift evidence
        Health->>Store: Commit snapshot with shadow-mode flag
        opt status changed
            Health->>Live: Publish health update
            Live-)View: Deliver live event
        end
    end

    opt analyst opens model health
        View->>Health: Request cohort and window
        Health->>Store: Read latest snapshot and history
        Store-->>Health: Bounded health evidence
        Health-->>View: Present scoped result
    end
